    <item>
      <title>亚洲汽车库存集会在特朗普的迹象上征收关税的迹象</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/asian-auto-stocks-rally-on-signs-of-trump-reprieve-from-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）表示，他正在考虑对进口车辆和汽车零件的关税豁免后，亚洲汽车制造商的股价周二攀升。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/asian-auto-stocks-rally-on-signs-of-trump-reprieve-from-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 01:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当贸易战焦虑灭绝时，黄金稳定在记录以下</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/gold-steadies-just-below-record-as-trade-war-anxiety-simmers</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于美国计划对投资者的焦虑征收更多关税，因此在本周开幕式上，黄金持有的公司在本周开幕式上的创纪录高度低下。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/gold-steadies-just-below-record-as-trade-war-anxiety-simmers</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 00:28:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
