    <item>
      <title>日本领导的股票上涨在自动关税缓刑方面：市场包装</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着唐纳德·特朗普总统在自动关税中潜在停顿，亚洲股票获得的股票获得了潜在的暂停，在暂停某些消费电子产品的征税后，为市场提供了进一步的缓解。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 22:56:52 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>油边缘更高，重点是关税动作，美国 - 伊朗讨论</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-15</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在周一进行温和的会议之后，石油上升了，交易员正在监视美国最新的贸易战争行动，并限制了对伊朗原油的限制。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-15</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 22:55:46 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Clearlake支持的RSA安全，债权人违反债务谈判</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/clearlake-backed-rsa-security-creditors-break-off-debt-talks</link>
      <description><![CDATA[据了解情况，无法实现Clearlake Capital支持的RSA安全性与一群贷方之间的机密谈判，但在债务重组的任期后就分解了。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/clearlake-backed-rsa-security-creditors-break-off-debt-talks</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 22:14:02 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>巴西提供石油块的石油块</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/brazil-to-offer-oil-blocks-where-petrobras-is-fighting-to-drill</link>
      <description><![CDATA[巴西石油监管机构将在一个有希望的海上地区授予勘探权，在该地区，国家控制的石油生产商Petrobras已与环境当局面临长达一年的纠纷，以开始钻探。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/brazil-to-offer-oil-blocks-where-petrobras-is-fighting-to-drill</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 19:54:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Catl认为美国关税的影响很小，对Outlook有信心</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/catl-reports-33-jump-in-net-income-even-as-battery-prices-fall</link>
      <description><![CDATA[全球最大的电池制造商当代安培技术有限公司有限公司对美国关税的影响很小，并且对电动汽车前景的看法仍然看涨。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/catl-reports-33-jump-in-net-income-even-as-battery-prices-fall</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 11:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在特朗普关税战争中，数十亿美元的出埃及记在中国ETF</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/emerging-market-etf-outflows-hit-5-57-bln-most-in-over-a-year</link>
      <description><![CDATA[投资者正在以创纪录的速度倾倒交易所贸易资金，跟踪中国股票，因为全球最大的经济体在一场不断升级的贸易战中面对，这将挑战全球增长。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/emerging-market-etf-outflows-hit-5-57-bln-most-in-over-a-year</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 10:00:20 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票和债券爬上一周的动荡：市场包裹</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一定程度的平静返回华尔街，在唐纳德·特朗普总统的颠覆性贸易战的束缚中，股票和债券在动荡不安的一周后赢得了双胞胎集会。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
